{"id":"n54870-2-7","stage":1,"title":"무게 · 重心","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n54870-2-7-1","ko":"이 프로그램은 하나도 재미가 없어.","zh":"这个节目一点意思都没有。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"프로그램은","meaning":"节目，节目单","explanation":"프로그램：节目，节目单；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"프로그램","audio":"/audio/f5044b9ba86548c9549b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60621","senseId":"2","lemma":"프로그램","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하나도","meaning":"完全","explanation":"하나：完全；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20283","senseId":"4","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재미가","meaning":"兴趣，趣味","explanation":"재미：兴趣，趣味；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"재미","audio":"/audio/1ad5f1ed1dfcf49c8405.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75754","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"f5044b9ba86548c9","term":"프로그램","zh":"节目，节目单","audio":"/audio/f5044b9ba86548c9549b.mp3","entryId":"60621","definition":"在广播、电视等里，按时间段播放的内容；或指其顺序或目录。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"完全","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20283","definition":"全然，毫无。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"1ad5f1ed1dfcf49c","term":"재미","zh":"兴趣，趣味","audio":"/audio/1ad5f1ed1dfcf49c8405.mp3","entryId":"75754","definition":"使人感到愉快的气氛或感觉。","pronunciation":["재미"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/2089998e9091b85263a9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n54870-2-7-2","ko":"당연하지. 재미보다는 시사성에 더 무게를 뒀으니까.","zh":"当然，它更重视时事性而非娱乐性。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"당연하지.","meaning":"当然","explanation":"당연하다：当然；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"당연하다","audio":"/audio/8103840df277907313f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49496","senseId":"1","lemma":"당연하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재미보다는","meaning":"兴趣，趣味","explanation":"재미：兴趣，趣味；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"재미","audio":"/audio/1ad5f1ed1dfcf49c8405.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75754","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시사성에","meaning":"时事","explanation":"시사：时事；성：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시사","audio":"/audio/13930dbff1f140d0398a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85242","senseId":"1","lemma":"시사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무게를","meaning":"重心，分量，价值","explanation":"무게：重心，分量，价值；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"무게","audio":"/audio/35f5385457736f8b7af4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54870","senseId":"2","lemma":"무게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뒀으니까.","meaning":"放在","explanation":"두다：放在；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니까：在句末解释原因或依据：“因为、毕竟”。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"9","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8103840df2779073","term":"당연하다","zh":"当然","audio":"/audio/8103840df277907313f8.mp3","entryId":"49496","definition":"按道理应当是那样的。","pronunciation":["당연하다"]},{"id":"1ad5f1ed1dfcf49c","term":"재미","zh":"兴趣，趣味","audio":"/audio/1ad5f1ed1dfcf49c8405.mp3","entryId":"75754","definition":"使人感到愉快的气氛或感觉。","pronunciation":["재미"]},{"id":"13930dbff1f140d0","term":"시사","zh":"时事","audio":"/audio/13930dbff1f140d0398a.mp3","entryId":"85242","definition":"当时发生的各种社会性事件。","pronunciation":["시사"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"35f5385457736f8b","term":"무게","zh":"重心，分量，价值","audio":"/audio/35f5385457736f8b7af4.mp3","entryId":"54870","definition":"事物或现象的重要程度。","pronunciation":["무게"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"放在","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"认为某一对象重要或有价值，认真对待。","pronunciation":["두다"]}],"audio":"/audio/987dbd0fb4eda545f44b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.29,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=54870","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":42,"sequenceScore":1.9434,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["当然，它更重视时事性而非娱乐性。","承奎又去厕所了吗？","这个节目一点意思都没有。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["当然，它更重视时事性而非娱乐性。","这个节目一点意思都没有。","承奎又去厕所了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
